4","videoBytes":134497,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["What is the man doing now? He is playing basketball.","What did the man play earlier? He played basketball.","Yes, we played chess.","What did Nadia do last night? She did her homework.","What is Nadia doing right now? She is doing her homework.","What are they playing now? They are playing tag.","Did you draw anything yesterday?","Yes, I danced with my friends.","Did you eat dinner last night?","Who did you visit? I visited my grandparents.","When did you visit them? I visited them last week.","How did you get there? We rode the subway.","I went to the park yesterday.","She watched a movie last night.","Did you cry during the movie?","They had a pillow fight last night.","We played games yesterday.","He studied English last weekend.","Did you go swimming yesterday?","Where did you go? I went to the library.","What did you do there? I read some books.","I had cereal and toast for breakfast.","What did you have for breakfast this morning?","Did you sleep well last night?","Yes, I slept very well.","What did you wear yesterday?","I wore a blue shirt and jeans.","Did you talk to your friend yesterday?","I threw a ball to my friend.","Yes, we talked on the phone.","What did he say?","He told me about his day.","Did you finish your project?","Yes, I finished it last week.","What time did you wake up this morning?","I woke up at seven o'clock.","Did you take a shower last night?","Yes, I took a shower before bed.","What did you drink with lunch?","I drank orange juice with lunch.","Did you help your mother yesterday?","Yes, I helped her wash the dishes.","What did you learn in school today?","I learned about dinosaurs.","Did you listen to music last night?","Yes, I listened to my favorite songs.","What did you buy at the store?","Yes, I carried bags from the store.","I bought some snacks and a magazine.","Did you dance at the party?","What did you laugh about?","I laughed at a funny joke.","A little bit, it was sad.","What did you write in your journal?","I wrote about my weekend.","Yes, I drew a picture of my family.","What did you sing?","I sang my favorite pop song.","What did you cook for dinner?","I cooked pasta with tomato sauce.","Did you ride your bike yesterday?","What did you see on your walk?","I saw birds and squirrels.","Did you climb the tree?","Yes, I climbed it with my brother.","What did you find?","I found some interesting rocks.","Did you collect anything?","Yes, I collected leaves for my project.","What did you build with blocks?","I built a tall tower.","Did you break anything?","I accidentally broke a cup.","What did you fix?","My dad and I fixed my bicycle.","Did you carry anything heavy?","What did you push?","I pushed the shopping cart.","Did you pull the rope?","Yes, we played tug-of-war.","What did you throw?","Did you catch it?","No, it fell to the ground.","What did you hide?","I hid a surprise for my sister.","Did you search for it?","What did you cut?","I folded the paper into a paper airplane.","I cut the paper with scissors.","Yes, I used glue to stick pictures.","What did you fold?","Did you open the window?","Yes, I opened it to get fresh air."]}
